(7173904, 1101169, 8759, '<td valign="top">8 years ago, in this area of Seoul, me, my wife and my daughter met Peter, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">docpjv</a>. We were on an epic journey from China sort of back to Europe. It was also after my dad passed away, loosing a short battle with the same enemy Peter so bravely fights. <br/> <br/>We met and we clicked, we laughed, we ate we drank. We stayed in touch. <br/> <br/>When we planned this year trip we tried to arrange in such a way that we can wee Peter again only that he had to leave just a bit earlier. <br/> <br/>I did stroll the streets with him in mind and I did think of him when I took this picture.</td>', '8 years ago, in this area of Seoul, me, my wife and my daughter met Peter,  docpjv. We were on an epic journey from China sort of back to Europe. It was also after my dad passed away, loosing a short battle with the same enemy Peter so bravely fights.  We met and we clicked, we laughed, we ate we drank. We stayed in touch.  When we planned this year trip we tried to arrange in such a way that we can wee Peter again only that he had to leave just a bit earlier.  I did stroll the streets with him in mind and I did think of him when I took this picture.', '2014-02-10 06:12:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7173921, 1101277, 66641, '<td valign="top">This was my favourite, I LOVE this shot.</td>', 'This was my favourite, I LOVE this shot.', '2014-02-10 07:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7173925, 1101169, 8759, '<td valign="top">@<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=124815" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">mariuca</a> <br/> <br/>it''s the motion blur of the leg :) no over sharpening hihi<br/> <br/>100% crop of the original<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1102186" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/8759/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1102186.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/8759/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1102186.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5000-9999/8759/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1102186.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Edit: sharpening did enhance somehow the effect <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-10 07:37:35.</i></td>', '@ mariuca  it''s the motion blur of the leg :) no over sharpening hihi 100% crop of the original   Edit: sharpening did enhance somehow the effect ', '2014-02-10 07:36:21.000000', '2014-02-10 07:37:35.000000', 0),
