(7173935, 1101277, 152252, '<td valign="top">This is so funny. I love the colours. Great editing, reminds me of Polaroid pictures. You were one of my 10s. Congratulations on top 5! :)</td>', 'This is so funny. I love the colours. Great editing, reminds me of Polaroid pictures. You were one of my 10s. Congratulations on top 5! :)', '2014-02-10 08:05:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7173940, 1100651, 12611, '<td valign="top">first off, the movement of the figure, the dynamic lighting, is superb, and beckons the viewer to search out the head, yet comforted by the fact that the head is not necessary here.<br/> <br/>Secondly, I imagine a conversation later on the day of your shoot-"well dear, you just won''t believe what I saw through the window of the Williams house on the corner, quite fascinating actually..."</td>', 'first off, the movement of the figure, the dynamic lighting, is superb, and beckons the viewer to search out the head, yet comforted by the fact that the head is not necessary here. Secondly, I imagine a conversation later on the day of your shoot-"well dear, you just won''t believe what I saw through the window of the Williams house on the corner, quite fascinating actually..."', '2014-02-10 08:25:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7173942, 1101277, 114285, '<td valign="top"><b></b><i></i>Originally posted by Neat:<br/>LOL, who are they Mark please tell?<br/> <br/>A couple of friends of mine who are siblings. I thought it would be fun to have them dress up and they were nice enough to do it. They didn''t really think it was very good but I did try to convince them all week that it was pure genius...haha. They were very happy that it did well and appreciated all the comments, though. <br/> <br/>Thank you everyone.<br/> <br/>Thanks Mark, just think though no one will recognise them!<br/> <br/>Tell them that they are amazing!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-02-10 08:29:30.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Neat:LOL, who are they Mark please tell? A couple of friends of mine who are siblings. I thought it would be fun to have them dress up and they were nice enough to do it. They didn''t really think it was very good but I did try to convince them all week that it was pure genius...haha. They were very happy that it did well and appreciated all the comments, though.  Thank you everyone. Thanks Mark, just think though no one will recognise them! Tell them that they are amazing!', '2014-02-10 08:27:18.000000', '2014-02-10 08:29:30.000000', 0),
